@baseUrl = https://localhost:5002

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345",
  "phoneNumber": "+48123456789",
  "acceptedPrivacyPolicy": true,
  "acceptedDataProcessingConsent": true
}

### Get token using client credentials (service-to-service)
# Note: ApiClientSecret must be configured in appsettings or environment variables
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=lotrokoniecdev-api&client_secret=<your_api_client_secret>&scope=api service

### Refresh token (for web client after authorization code flow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=lotrokoniecdev-web&refresh_token=<your_refresh_token_here>

### Get user info (requires valid access token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer <your_access_token_here>

### Revoke token
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=<your_token_here>&client_id=lotrokoniecdev-web

### Health check - liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health check - readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
